% TSS NORD-10 + SWAPPING DRUM VARIANT (EXPERIMENTAL - NOT AN ORIGINAL SCRIPT!)
% DERIVED FROM ASSYSA:SYMB WITH THESE DELIBERATE CHANGES:
%   + N10   MARK: NORD-10 CODE PATHS (IOX I/O, ION/IOF) - REQUIRED FOR XDRUM
%   + DRUM  MARK: COMPILES IN XDRUM/TRSFR DRUM SWAPPING (TSS1 LINES 3711-3874)
%   - INTDS/INTEN PRE-DEFINITIONS REMOVED: UNDER "N10" TSS1 (LINES 103-106)
%     DEFINES INTDS=IOF, INTEN=ION ITSELF; PRE-DEFINING WOULD DOUBLE-DEFINE
% ALL OTHER CVS SYMBOL DEFINITIONS ARE KEPT: DIABD/DIABT/IOT/ACT/... ARE
% REFERENCED BY UNGUARDED CODE (E.G. TSS1 LINE 2658 LEV6 DIABLO PROBE) AND
% MUST STAY DEFINED. NOTE: THAT PROBE ASSEMBLES NORD-1 "IOT" OPCODE WORDS
% EVEN IN THE N10 BUILD - REVIEW BEFORE RUNNING ON REAL/EMULATED ND-100.
% DRMSZ DEFAULTS TO 2000 OCTAL 256-WORD PAGES (SET DRMSZ=... HERE TO OVERRIDE)
% XDRUM EXPECTS DRUM CONTROLLER AT DEVICE 540 (IOX 540+0..7)
% CLKFX (ADDED 2026-10-08): ASSEMBLES TBANG'S FOUR CLOCK CONSTANTS (TSS2 K1-K4) AS
%   48-BIT FLOATS SO THE TIME OF DAY ADVANCES. THE 1978 BUILDS HAVE 32-BIT
%   CONSTANTS AND A FROZEN CLOCK; THE GOLDEN ASSYSA/ASSYSB INPUTS MUST NOT SET
%   THIS MARK (IT ADDS FOUR WORDS AFTER TBANG). SEE docs/TSS-FLOAT-FORMAT.md.
CDC MACF DIAB K14 TEL4 DRUM N10 CLKFX
IOT=160000;ACT=400;SKA=1000;PIN=2000;SNI=0;     % Added by CVS
TDBI=410; TDBO=40             % Added by CVS
DIABD=156; TT3=162; TT4=DIABD; DIABT=4; DLP=143 % Added by CVS
GRP1=1;GRP2=2;GRP3=4;GRP4=10;
MPR=3;
8LP=200; 9PPT=100; 9TTI=40; 9TTO=40
9FP=200; 9CR=5; NOPEN=16
)9ASSM TSS1,"LIST1:SYMB",0
)9ASSM TSS2,"LIST2:SYMB",0
)9ASSM TSS3,"LIST3:SYMB",0
)9ASSM TSS4,"LIST4:SYMB",0
)9ASSM TSS5,"LIST5:SYMB","DSYMB:SYMB"
)LIST
)9EXIT
